<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Denbury, Saba.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Denbury, Saba.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co initiated coverage of Saba Petroleum Co with a buy recommendation and raised the rating on Denbury Resources Inc to outperfrom from market perform, according to an Oppenheimer source.</p>
<p>-- Saba shares were up 1/2 to 22 on the American Stock Exchange while Denbury's Nasdaq-listed shares added 3/16 to 12-5/16.</p>
</text>
